The remaining shells are $700 - 280 = 420$.
The The Finders found 60% of the remaining shells.
The number of shells found by the The Finders is $0.60 \times 420 = 252$.

The number of shells found by team Gogetters is the remaining shells after the Alphas and The Finders found their shells.
Shells found by Gogetters = Total shells - (Shells found by Alphas) - (Shells found by The Finders)
Shells found by Gogetters = $700 - 280 - 252 = 700 - (280 + 252) = 700 - 532 = 168$.

