The remaining percentage is $100\% - 40\% - 36\% = 100\% - 76\% = 24\%$.
The Gogetters found 24% of the total shells, so they found $0.24 \times 700 = 0.24 \times 7 \times 100 = 1.68 \times 100 = 168$.

The number of shells team Gogetters found is 168.
